  "finding": {
    "analysis_policy": "append_only",
    "docs_policy": "mutable",
    "why_it_matters": "`analysis` is append_only: every file it pins must stay byte-identical. `docs` is mutable: editing one is reported and is not a failure. So an edit under audits/ never breaks a release, but an edit under analysis/ does - including to pricing research that no official score depends on.",
